# BuildKit reads this file for deploy/review-runner/Dockerfile instead of a root
# .dockerignore. The build context is the repository root; send only what
# `pip install /src` and the entrypoint COPY need, never .env, .git, .tine,
# .venv or other local state (a COPY layer keeps it even after rm -rf /src).
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!opentine/
!docs/compliance/
!deploy/review-runner/entrypoint.sh
**/__pycache__
